# Testing (Resolve)

## Pyramid

| Layer | Command | Expectation |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| Unit `lib/` | `bun run test:lib` | Pure logic co-located `*.test.ts` |
| Components | `bun run test` | `ComponentName.test.tsx` next to component |
| API integration | `bun run test:integration` | Auth + Zod per route; mock Supabase at boundary |
| DB / RLS | `bun run db:test:rls` | Local Supabase only |
| E2E | `CI=true bun run e2e` | Critical flows after seed + build |

## Conventions

- Arrange-Act-Assert; use `frontend/test/fixtures/` for shared data.
- Prefer testing behavior over implementation details.
- After API auth changes, extend integration tests (cron, org, 401 paths).
- `bun run check` must pass before PR.
